# HTTP request samples for the dual-stream interval join service.
# Usable with IntelliJ/VS Code HTTP clients, or read alongside demo.sh
# which contains the same requests as curl commands.

@host = http://localhost:8080
@job = acc

### 1. Create a job: interval [0,10000]ms, 5s idle detection, per-side
###    buffer cap 3 with REJECT (never drop a buffered matchable record).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{job}}",
  "lowerBound": 0,
  "upperBound": 10000,
  "left":  { "maxOutOfOrderness": 0, "idleTimeoutMillis": 5000, "maxBufferSize": 3, "overflowPolicy": "REJECT" },
  "right": { "maxOutOfOrderness": 0, "idleTimeoutMillis": 5000, "maxBufferSize": 3, "overflowPolicy": "REJECT" }
}

### 2. Push left events (processing time is injected manually).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/events/left
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processingTime": 1000,
  "events": [
    { "id": "L1", "key": "k", "eventTime": 10000, "value": "order-1" },
    { "id": "L2", "key": "k", "eventTime": 12000, "value": "order-2" }
  ]
}

### 3. Push right events: 3 pairs emitted (R3 at 22001 is 1ms past boundary).
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/events/right
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processingTime": 2000,
  "events": [
    { "id": "R1", "key": "k", "eventTime": 15000 },
    { "id": "R2", "key": "k", "eventTime": 22000 },
    { "id": "R3", "key": "k", "eventTime": 22001 }
  ]
}

### 4. Status: independent watermarks, buffer sizes, counters.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/status

### 5. Simulate the RIGHT side stalling: no more right events; advance
###    processing time past the 5s idle timeout.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/time
Content-Type: application/json

{ "advanceTo": 8000 }

### 6. The stalled side resumes — previously buffered records still match.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/events/right
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processingTime": 9000,
  "events": [ { "id": "R4", "key": "k", "eventTime": 10500 } ]
}

### 7. Explicit watermark injection drives boundary-exact state cleanup.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/watermark/left
Content-Type: application/json

{ "processingTime": 11000, "watermark": 20000 }

### 8. Over-cap event is refused, buffered records are retained.
POST {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}/events/left
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "processingTime": 12000,
  "events": [ { "id": "LBUFOVER", "key": "k", "eventTime": 20001 } ]
}

### 9. List jobs, then delete this one.
GET {{host}}/api/v1/jobs

###
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/jobs/{{job}}
